{
  "id": "encounter_23_treasure_resonance",
  "title": "仙缘灵宝 — 宝物共鸣",
  "description": "身上携带的某件宝物突然发出奇异共鸣，似乎在感应附近的其他灵宝",
  "type": "item",
  "probability": 0.08,
  "trigger_conditions": {
    "region": "zhongyuan",
    "min_realm": "qi_refining_mid",
    "cooldown_minutes": 10
  },
  "dao_heart_alignment": "neutral",
  "start_node": "TREASURE_RESONANCE_START",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "TREASURE_RESONANCE_START",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你突然感到怀中某件物品微微发烫，取出查看后发现它正在发出淡金色的光芒。\n\n这种共鸣现象只有在附近存在同源灵宝时才会出现...\n\n你顺着共鸣的方向望去，发现光芒似乎在指引你前往某个地方。",
      "next_node": "TREASURE_RESONANCE_CHOICE"
    },
    {
      "id": "TREASURE_RESONANCE_CHOICE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "宝物的共鸣越来越强烈，你需要做出决定。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "follow_resonance",
          "text": "跟随共鸣的指引，寻找源头",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "time_advance",
              "value": 15
            },
            {
              "type": "skill_check",
              "target": "luck",
              "operator": ">=",
              "value": 10
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "TREASURE_FOLLOW"
        },
        {
          "id": "analyze_first",
          "text": "先分析宝物状态，确认共鸣的原因",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "skill_check",
              "target": "knowledge",
              "operator": ">=",
              "value": 12
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "TREASURE_ANALYZE_CHECK"
        },
        {
          "id": "suppress_resonance",
          "text": "压制共鸣，避免暴露自己拥有宝物",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "dao_heart_change",
              "value": 2
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "TREASURE_SUPPRESS_END"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TREASURE_FOLLOW",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你跟随共鸣的指引穿过山谷，来到一处隐蔽的石洞前。\n\n洞中传来强烈的灵力波动，宝物在你手中震动得更加厉害。\n\n[b]你发现了一处灵宝埋藏之地！[/b]",
      "next_node": "TREASURE_DISCOVER_CHOICE"
    },
    {
      "id": "TREASURE_ANALYZE_CHECK",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你仔细感应宝物的共鸣频率，发现它与一种古老的炼器手法有关。\n\n这种共鸣说明附近有同源的炼器材料或成品灵宝。",
      "next_node": "TREASURE_ANALYZE_RESULT"
    },
    {
      "id": "TREASURE_ANALYZE_RESULT",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "[b]分析成功：[/b]你判断共鸣源自东方约三里处的一处山谷。\n\n根据共鸣的强度，其中至少有一件黄阶以上的灵宝。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]灵宝位置信息",
      "next_node": "TREASURE_DISCOVER_CHOICE",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "item_give",
          "target": "treasure_location_info",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TREASURE_SUPPRESS_END",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你运转灵力压制了宝物的共鸣，将其重新收入怀中。\n\n虽然错过了一次可能的机缘，但谨慎行事也是一种修行。\n\n[b]道心：[/b]+2",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "give_exp",
          "value": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "item_give",
          "target": "spirit_crystal",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TREASURE_DISCOVER_CHOICE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你来到了共鸣源头，地面上隐约可见一个古老的法阵。\n\n法阵中央似乎有什么东西在发光。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "activate_array",
          "text": "尝试激活法阵，看会发生什么",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "skill_check",
              "target": "array_mastery",
              "operator": ">=",
              "value": 15
            },
            {
              "type": "dao_heart_change",
              "value": 5
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "TREASURE_ARRAY_END"
        },
        {
          "id": "dig_directly",
          "text": "不管法阵，直接挖掘发光之处",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "item_give",
              "target": "spirit_treasure_fragment",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "reputation_change",
              "target": "bold_cultivator",
              "value": 2
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "TREASURE_DIG_END"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TREASURE_ARRAY_END",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你按照感应到的灵力流向激活了法阵，一阵光芒闪过...\n\n法阵中央浮现出一件散发着柔和光芒的灵宝！\n\n[b]获得：[/b]共鸣灵宝（黄阶）\n[b]道心：[/b]+5\n\n此灵宝与你原有的宝物同源，两者配合使用效果更佳。",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "item_give",
          "target": "resonance_treasure",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TREASURE_DIG_END",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你不顾法阵的存在，直接动手挖掘发光之处。\n\n在泥土中发现了一块灵宝碎片，虽然不完整，但依然蕴含不少灵力。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]灵宝碎片 x1",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "item_give",
          "target": "treasure_fragment",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
